---
import Base from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<Base
  title={`Women-Only Tanzania — 8-Day Hosted Safari | Rendile Travels`}
  description={`An 8-day women-only hosted safari through the Serengeti and Ngorongoro, in an intimate small group with a female host, vetted camps and time with Maasai women. Day-by-day itinerary and prices from $8,900.`}
  ogTitle={`Women-Only Tanzania — 8-Day Hosted Safari | Rendile Travels`}
  ogDescription={`Our sisterhood departure through the Serengeti and Ngorongoro — 8 days, hosted, from $8,900.`}
  ogType={`website`}
  ogImage={`assets/img/tz-serengeti.jpg`}
  canonical={`https://rendiletravels.com/women-only-tanzania.html`}
  jsonld={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TouristTrip","name":"Women-Only Tanzania — 8-Day Hosted Safari","description":"An 8-day women-only hosted safari through the Serengeti and Ngorongoro in an intimate group.","image":"https://rendiletravels.com/assets/img/tz-serengeti.jpg","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Rendile Travels"},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"8900","priceCurrency":"USD"}}`}
  credit={`Imagery via Wikimedia Commons &amp; Pexels: Serengeti © Tanzania GET Safaris; Ngorongoro © Eric Kilby; Kilimanjaro © Sergey Pesterev. Licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">CC BY</a> / <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">CC BY-SA</a>.`}
>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-serengeti.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Tanzania · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Women-Only Tanzania</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>8 days</b></span>
        <span>Tarangire · Ngorongoro · Serengeti</span>
        <span>Small hosted group</span>
        <span>from <b>$8,900</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Women-Only%20Tanzania" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="tanzania.html">Tanzania</a> / Women-Only Tanzania</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Our sisterhood departure through Tanzania's north — the elephants of Tarangire, the Ngorongoro Crater and the endless Serengeti — in an intimate women-only group, led by a female host throughout.</p>
        <p>Vetted camps, thoughtful pacing and genuine connection — including time with the Maasai women whose cooperatives we support. Come solo and leave with friends.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 8-day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive &amp; gather in Arusha</h3><p>Met at Kilimanjaro Airport and welcomed to a leafy lodge, where the group comes together over a welcome dinner with your host.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Arusha country lodge · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Tarangire National Park</h3><p>An easy first safari day among the elephants and baobabs, settling into the rhythm together.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Tarangire tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Highlands &amp; Maasai women</h3><p>Up to the Ngorongoro highlands, with a visit to a Maasai women's beadwork cooperative — a warm, honest exchange over chai.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Ngorongoro crater-rim lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Ngorongoro Crater floor</h3><p>A full day in the crater — lions, rhino, elephant and flamingo-pink lakes — with a celebratory picnic on the floor.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Ngorongoro crater-rim lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Into the Serengeti</h3><p>Cross the plains into the Serengeti, game viewing as you go, to your camp in the central Seronera.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Serengeti tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Serengeti game drives</h3><p>A full day in big-cat country, with an optional dawn balloon and a champagne bush breakfast for those who wish.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Serengeti tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 7</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Serengeti &amp; sundowners</h3><p>More unhurried drives, then a final golden-hour gathering with sundowners as the plains turn to amber.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Serengeti tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 8</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly home together</h3><p>A last sunrise drive, then a light-aircraft flight back to Arusha — new friendships and a fuller heart for the journey home.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Where you'll stay</p><h2 class="section__title">Camps &amp; lodges</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Women-Only%20Tanzania"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-tent.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Tarangire tented camp</h3><p>Vetted, women-friendly &amp; warm.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Women-Only%20Tanzania"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-view.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Ngorongoro crater-rim lodge</h3><p>Sweeping views over the caldera.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Women-Only%20Tanzania"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-suite.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Serengeti tented camp</h3><p>Canvas luxury on the plains.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>All internal flights &amp; transfers</li>
          <li>Vetted lodges &amp; tented camps</li>
          <li>Female Rendile host throughout</li>
          <li>Shared 4x4 game drives with expert guides</li>
          <li>All game drives &amp; park fees</li>
          <li>Maasai women's cooperative visit</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge &amp; all gratuities</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$8,900 per person sharing</strong>; single rooms available on request. International flights, visas and the optional balloon safari are extra. Set departures run in the dry seasons (June–October &amp; January–March).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Join the sisterhood.</h2><p>Tell us your dates and we'll hold your place on the next women-only departure.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Women-Only%20Tanzania" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">More journeys</p><h2 class="section__title">Other Tanzania itineraries</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="classic-northern-circuit.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-ngorongoro.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Classic Northern Circuit</h3><p>8 days · private &amp; tailor-made.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="zanzibar-womens-retreat.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/trip-zanzibar.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Zanzibar Women's Retreat</h3><p>7 days · women-only wellness.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="tanzania.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-kilimanjaro.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>All Tanzania itineraries</h3><p>Browse every Tanzania journey.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
